WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:03.473
The real rabbits surrounded Rabbit!

2
00:00:03.474 --> 00:00:05.654
He shook his head.

3
00:00:05.655 --> 00:00:08.957
"What are you doing here?" he asked.

4
00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:13.233
The rabbits laughed.

5
00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:17.340
"What are you doing here?" the white rabbit said.

6
00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:23.668
Rabbit looked around and saw the mountains.

7
00:00:23.669 --> 00:00:30.091
He saw lots of pine trees.

8
00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:36.556
And ahead was the lake.

9
00:00:36.557 --> 00:00:41.215
"I think a fairy brought me here," Rabbit said.

10
00:00:41.216 --> 00:00:44.545
"A fairy?" the brown rabbit said.

11
00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:49.570
"Well, something magical happened," the spotted one said.

12
00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:53.328
"You have legs and feet now!"

13
00:00:53.329 --> 00:00:58.272
"So you can play with us!" the white rabbit said.

14
00:00:58.273 --> 00:01:01.141
"What?" Rabbit looked down.

15
00:01:01.142 --> 00:01:04.309
The real rabbits were right.

16
00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:09.452
He had real feet and long legs!

17
00:01:09.453 --> 00:01:16.601
Rabbit jumped and hopped with his new feet.

18
00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:21.006
"I'm a real rabbit!" he said.

19
00:01:21.007 --> 00:01:23.615
"I'm real!"

20
00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:32.832
All the rabbits jumped and cheered.

21
00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:40.221
They chased each other across the field.

22
00:01:40.222 --> 00:01:49.650
They played together until the sun went down.

23
00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:53.268
"Where will we sleep?" Rabbit asked.

24
00:01:53.269 --> 00:02:02.571
"Follow us!" the spotted rabbit said.

25
00:02:02.572 --> 00:02:08.646
Rabbit followed the others to a warm, cozy den.

26
00:02:08.647 --> 00:02:13.378
Everyone curled up, ready for bed.

27
00:02:13.379 --> 00:02:17.291
"What a wonderful day!" Rabbit thought.

28
00:02:17.292 --> 00:02:22.786
"Except for one thing—I miss Henry."

29
00:02:22.787 --> 00:02:25.924
"I hope he's okay," Rabbit thought.

30
00:02:25.925 --> 00:02:30.593
Rabbit fell asleep, still thinking of his friend.

31
00:02:30.594 --> 00:02:40.638
"I wonder if Henry misses me."

